{"id":"also","lemma":"also","pos":"adv","rank":66,"glosses":["so, well","therefore"],"ipa":"/ˈʔalzoː/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/82/De-also.ogg/De-also.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ist es also wahr?","en":"Is it really true?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/393783","words":[{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"true, real"}]},{"text":"Sie glauben mir also?","en":"So you do believe me?","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to believe something"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},null]},{"text":"Also, hast du dich entschieden?","en":"Well, have you decided?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759665","words":[null,{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"determined, resolute"}]},{"text":"Du glaubst mir also doch.","en":"So, you believe me after all.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to believe something","l":"glauben"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},null,{"g":"but / yes"}]},{"text":"Also darum hast du das gesagt.","en":"So that's why you said that.","words":[null,{"g":"around it, around that"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"}]}]}